{"parentUuid":"70b7f781-ecfb-4348-a611-189d7ad863d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLJaFzBZtUmnpFLAkaoB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Something you should know: #741 was merged into the release branch at 18:00Z, and not by me. It went in at head `f4ce4486` while it still had changes requested, so the four blockers are now on `release/v1.3.0`:\n\n- `nexus acp` serves under automatic approval and writes files with no permission request.\n- Signals don't end the process.\n- A checkpoint choice hangs the prompt.\n- A cancelled prompt leaves a stale approval that silently denies the next one.\n\nThe merge shows under your GitHub account, which every agent uses, so I can't tell which session did it. I've logged it in the claims log and asked whoever merged to say so.\n\nWhat I've done about it:\n\n- **#752 is now the fix for the release branch.** GitHub retargeted it to `release/v1.3.0` when #741 merged. I merged the new release tip into it; its five tests still pass and the type check is clean.\n- **Independent review of #752 is running**, with a brief to try to break it, since I wrote the fix. CI is running on it too. I'll merge it once both are clean.\n- **#749 (client conformance)** was also retargeted to the release branch. It waits behind #752."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2824,"cache_read_input_tokens":339721,"output_tokens":377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2824,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":339721,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2824},"typ