{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","hash":"8ff89fccdf5e55632b0444e257c2e5a0366368a4e61858f79b3d89d2d0073c7d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The #752 review came back as accept with follow-ups, and it flagged one defect in my fix: a cancel in a 2-second window could leave the session unusable. I've fixed that with a failing-then-passing test, pushed it, and I'm posting the review and waiting on CI before merging.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TYqJpxAUhno7LTNAjL8p7Q","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-mike-nexus-code/43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b/scratchpad/rev752.md","content":"**Independent review at `bf218d039eb00ebcd1b7ca0db2045ec3f7b0dc28` — ACCEPT WITH FOLLOW-UPS; the one defect it found is fixed in `c5397955`**\n\n**Found, and fixed in `c5397955`**\n\n- `stopping` could stick true forever (confirmed by running). `finishPrompt` waited up to 2 s for the receipt with the prompt still pending; a `$/cancel_request` in that window answered the prompt a second time and set `stopping` for a turn that had already ended, so every later prompt of the session was refused. The prompt now stops being pending before the receipt is awaited. New test for that window (it fails without the change).\n- Mutation survivor: removing `stopping = true` in the checkpoint path left the tests green. The checkpoint test now sends a prompt before the turn result and expects the refusal.\n\n**Held up when run at `bf218d03`**\n\n- Auto approval: `--yes`, `--mode auto`, `NEXUS_APPROVAL_MODE=auto`, and the same line in the throwaway HOME's `config.env` each exit 2 with the message and an empty stdout. `--read-only` combined with auto starts read-only. A project `.nexus.env` does not select auto. By reading, nothing after start-up can switch the mode (`always: false` is hardcoded, the adapter never sends `slash`, `_meta` is dropped).\n- Signals: idle, 143 and 130 in about 50 ms; with a permission pending, about 600 ms; no `harness-core` left behind.\n- Cancel with a permission pending, through the real adapter: the prompt got -32800, the next prompt asked again, only the approved file was written.\n- Mutations: removing the refusal, the `fullAccess` half of it, `process.exit`, the checkpoint handler, `dropPendingApproval` in the cancel path, or the `stopping` check each fails a test.\n- Tests at that head, 0 failures: `acp_jsonrpc` 11, `acp_mapping` 22, `acp_review_fixes` 5, `acp_schema` 7, `acp_stdio` 7, `acp_validate` 14, `sidecar` 55.\n\n**Follow-ups, not blocking**\n\n- `close()` awaits each sidecar's shutdown with no upper bound; a hung `idle()` would block the exit after a signal. A hard-exit timer would bound it.\n- `dropPendingApproval` in `finishPrompt` is not covered by a test (the mutation survives).\n- `stopping` is cleared only by a `turn.result`; a sidecar that errors instead of ending the turn would leave it set.\n- Deny then cancel are two commands: the turn can reach the model between them. No stray response reached the client when run.\n\n**Not checked:** `session/load` of a saved session that carries a mode; a checkpoint choice end to end through the real sidecar; two rapid cancels; the commit `c5397955` itself beyond its own tests and CI.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R8hWNibNwQKPXsq4ov3iUR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/nexus-code && gh pr comment 752 --body-file /tmp/claude-1000/-home-mike-nexus-code/43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b/scratchpad/rev752.md | tail -1; bash -c 'sleep 45; for i in $(seq 1 17); do c=$(gh pr checks 752 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(test-matrix|linux-x86_64)\" | grep -c pass); f=$(gh pr checks 752 2>&1 | grep -E \"^test-|^linux\" | grep -c fail); [ \"$c\" = 3 ] && break; [ \"$f\" != 0 ] && break; sleep 30; done; gh pr checks 752 2>&1 | grep -E \"^test-matrix|^linux-x86_64|^test-.*(fail|pending)\" | cut -c1-55; gh run list --branch release/v1.3.0 --workflow ci.yml --limit 1 --json status,conclusion,headSha --jq \".[0]|[.status,.conclusion,.headSha[0:8]]|@tsv\"'","description":"Post the review on PR 752 and wait for its checks and the release CI","timeout":590000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
