{"parentUuid":"02a2e38e-54bd-49c6-9637-4046fdeee1f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLMUfunWiGH2bM5ssUkc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ACP work is now on the release branch with its four blockers closed, and the branch is green at `45b9fad9`. No PRs are open.\n\n**What happened**\n- **#741 and #749 were merged by another session**, at 18:00Z and 18:16Z, while #741 still had changes requested. That put the four defects on the release branch: auto approval served, signals ignored, checkpoint choice hanging, stale approval after a cancel. I logged an alert in the claims log and asked whoever is merging to say so.\n- **#752 fixes all four and is merged.** It was reviewed independently before merging, with a brief to break it. The review confirmed the fixes by running them and found one defect in my code: a cancel arriving while a finished prompt fetched its receipt answered the prompt twice and left the session refusing every later prompt. I fixed that with a test that fails without the fix.\n- **Checked before merging:** all ACP test files passed against the fix, including the client-conformance test that came in with #749.\n\n**Follow-ups from the #752 review, not blocking**\n- Shutdown after a signal has no upper time bound if a session hangs while stopping.\n- The \"still stopping\" guard is cleared only by a turn result, so a sidecar that errors instead of ending the turn would leave it set.\n\n**Where v1.3.0 stands**\n- Now on the release branch: AC-1 and AC-2, in addition to the units already listed as done.\n- Not started: PF-3, PF-4, VR-2, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2. GV-1 slices 3–4 and the GV-5 allowlists are unfinished.\n- Still needs you: which units roll to v1.4, and the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the tag.\n- Also yours to settle: two sessions are merging into the release branch. You gave this session the merge queue; if another agent should be merging too, tell me, otherwise it needs to stop, because #741 went in over a standing request for changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1285,"cache_read_input_tokens":356248,"output_tokens":660,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1285,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":356248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1285},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChLMUfVEdXaSPDoDJSCvo","requestRef":"36e32def-a6f9-4a90-89f7-8e350fb58785","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"830555f1-3ce3-4c6e-8553-5a26cb007e30","timestamp":"2026-11-23T18:44:16.985Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
